    {
      "id": "claim_1e5fa614f2be4c56a1ec74d10b9e02e3",
      "statement": "The offline indexing workflow is implemented in rag.py, which reads the workbook from the FILE_PATH env var (defaulting to data/stats.xlsx), iterates six fixed sheet labels through loader.load_excel_data, and persists all resulting Document chunks to ./chroma_db via Chroma.from_documents.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://loader.py#L7-L62",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d7caeb0941076209b38387edd656eaf887f1bc5fc8367cd510edb11781ffab35:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://rag.py#L1-L29",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:09e4b4a837c3aed47bb95735da613df4334b054f27fa238729e558f9ba5b90c6:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_cf150d9750724f7c8921c66f5b213915",
      "statement": "rag.py indexes exactly six sheet labels: Normal Οικον Βάση, Normal Οικον Βάση - Crisis, Normal Οικον Βάση - COVID, Normal Κοινων Βάση, Normal Κοινων Βάση - Crisis, and Normal Κοινων Βάση - COVID.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://rag.py#L8-L15",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f1ae06baff61812bad67f47107ab69936fe0898e5371afe8951f7f8960df9fdb:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e4c7d8fc82fa497bbc1ef818d506f266",
      "statement": "loader.load_excel_data converts one workbook sheet into Document objects, one per region x indicator x era, carrying region/indicator/era/source metadata. Eras are Expansion (Προ Κρίσης) 2005-2008, Crisis (Κρίση) 2009-2013, and Recovery (Ανάκαμψη) 2014-2023, and each chunk's page_content pairs regional values with the national (Ελλάδα) values.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://loader.py#L11-L59",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ec2fdca15fcf228c67c8b21c22718d877661beb0140b6a0cb63e7058ced2b2cd:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2a02a9b01c43445aae4c11f30cb5c04a",
      "statement": "POST /ask in main.py is the quick RAG path using gemini-2.5-flash and the llm|StrOutputParser chain. It runs vectorstore.similarity_search(question, k=10), collects region metadata from the results, fuzzy-matches the question against a hardcoded list of 13 Greek regions using thefuzz.fuzz.partial_ratio, and for each region where partial_ratio > 80 and the region is not already in the result set runs a second similarity_search with k=5 and a region filter to pull extra chunks. It never reads the workbook directly.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://main.py#L29-L54",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f278a8343c0706ea29854fcf9ecba840742da03b349e38e4b4aedf7e104e3a2d:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_30e505a1994d4b88a9ea19d0f4ff413f",
      "statement": "The /ask fuzzy region-expansion uses a hardcoded list of 13 Greek regions (Αττική, Θεσσαλία, Κρήτη, Βόρειο Αιγαίο, Κεντρική Μακεδονία, Δυτική Μακεδονία, Ήπειρος, Ιόνια Νησιά, Δυτική Ελλάδα, Στερεά Ελλάδα, Πελοπόννησος, Νότιο Αιγαίο, Ανατολική Μακεδονία και Θράκη) with a partial_ratio threshold strictly greater than 80.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://main.py#L34-L46",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:936e46b48f3577497f22ae09926a7711b030d139c73fc7794c40e6ea96a6f517:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4ca09e933a0d4888a9d27f750101f487",
      "statement": "POST /agent in main.py delegates to the LangChain agent from agent.py by calling agent.invoke with a user message and config thread_id research-session-3, returning the last message content as the answer; thread_id is hardcoded so all requests in one process share conversational memory.",
