      "statement": "available_tools exposes 13 tools: search_regions, compare_regions, calculate_percent_change, calculate_resilience_score, calculate_rti_score, calculate_recovery_speed, analyze_socioeconomic_coupling, calculate_structural_shift, save_finding, read_findings, calculate_rtix_score, calculate_crisis_comparison, and calculate_vulnerability_index.",
