      "id": "claim_096e32daff9c4b198a637373e7696a26",
      "statement": "The agent tools split across two data sources: search_regions and compare_regions run ChromaDB similarity_search with a $and metadata filter on region/indicator/era (mapping user era terms to canonical era names), while calculate_percent_change, calculate_resilience_score, calculate_rti_score, calculate_recovery_speed, analyze_socioeconomic_coupling, calculate_structural_shift, calculate_rtix_score, calculate_crisis_comparison, and calculate_vulnerability_index read the workbook directly with pd.read_excel on fixed sheet/column labels.",
